-- Sovietski: the SM-150 Snow Leopard combat snowmobile, the SM-212 Red Lightning fast-attack motorcycle with its three sidecars, and the SM-349 Street Sickle cyborg trike (printed 182-187).
-- 3 vehicle rows, with 23 locations and 9 weapon entries.
--
-- One-off data script, run once per environment. NOT a migration - it adds
-- rows, not schema.
--
--   node scripts/d1-apply.mjs --local apps/character-creator/db/~387-sovietski-v3.sql
--
